      "mergeID": "5ad97087cb342928b024b84f",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Like in RecRoom, or Altspace. Panoramas are fun and all but I just want a normal picture. SteamVR compresses these too much and not enough control of where you take the picture from since it's locked to your head.",
