      "spam": false,
      "value": "@{5980059a0f0b831904883973|full_name}: Each camera uses multiple render textures.  The framerate drop would be quite significant if everyone could bring one out.  \n\nOne solution community mentioned was making it local only, which would make total sense.  That way everyone could still see you were holding the camera but wouldn't see the render textures.  Also the pics that pop out could have be limited to only last pic taken for users.\n\nReason right now is we haven't gotten to it yet, but we'll get there eventually :)",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
