      "value": "@{58c6305fa0065508be77a317|full_name}: I think this is the best solution re: local rendering only for the render textures on the cameras. Having one out and pointed in a certain way should be communicated to other players via a camera model, but the \"viewfinder\" should only be rendered locally. This is a great idea.",
