      "value": "@{59715a9e4979f85df8d62ef5|full_name}: Have you not seen the Polaroid camera? That's exactly that and more. It was in at launch. Updates to Unity broke it. It is host spawnable only but the intention is to make something all players can use. It has a player ID. It also prints out pictures and labels who took them on the back. The picture itself has a sheen to it and is an object with collision. It also saves to your computer. There's two other cameras also... ;)",
